# Installation hum harvesters.
#
# A harvester placed here (`<topic>.mjs`, same shape as the bundled ones in the
# parent dir) runs when data/hum-interests.json enables a topic whose script is
# that file name: agent/scripts/hum-harvest-all.mjs resolveHarvesterPath looks
# in the kernel dir first, then here. A bundled harvester wins on a name. Add
# the topic's lane to agent/local/config/hum-lanes.json (extend_place_bound /
# extend_operational) when it is location-bound or operational.
#
# Everything here except this file is gitignored — see .gitignore and
# docs/architecture-public-private.md.
